('If the bank runs out of water, spice or Solari, are gains limited? How does running out of troop cubes in your supply differ?', 'Resources unlimited substitute; troop recruitment requires supply cube, cannot recruit until some return. Resource gains from/payments to bank.', 'Main PDF pp5,10,16', 'Unlimited resources versus finite troop supply'),
